# Magic-constant fitting on rsqrt and friends.  The reported "best" K is
# sampled and is NOT the true minimax (see FINDINGS.md).
rsqrt(x: f32 in 0.01..100) = 1/sqrt(x)
guess(x: f32, K: u32) = asfloat(K - (asuint(x) >> 1))
fit guess ~ rsqrt
find rsqrt 2
fit guess ~ rsqrt metric maxabs
fit guess ~ rsqrt metric rms
rsqrt2(x: f32 in 1..2) = 1/sqrt(x)
fit guess ~ rsqrt2
